- `ImageResizeHandles.tsx`: the grips are pointer-only. A writer who cannot drag
  has no way to set a picture's size — undo recovers a drag, but nothing offers
  one. The natural home is the object surface's ⋮ beside alt text
  (`features/editor/surfaces/objects`), which already carries Reset size and is
  already reachable by keyboard; a role on the grips themselves would promise a
  focus path the editor's Tab does not give them.
